serif\"'>ACE OF DIAMOND &amp; SHADOWS\r\n  OFTIME – remedial measures</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=67 valign=top style='width:50.6pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;\r\n  border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:justify'><b><span\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>R.8(32)</span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=466 valign=top style='width:349.6pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid black 1.0pt;border-right:solid black 1.0pt;\r\n  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:justify'><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>DREAMLINER (Sore) – to be\r\n  passed fit (VO)</span></p>\r\n  <p class=MsoNoSpacing style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:justify'><span\r\n  style='font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>LAZOR RAZOR – Mock Race\r\n  (Stipendiary Stewards)</span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:justify'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.5pt;text-align:justify'><b><u><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\";color:#0070C0'>RE:\r\nRACE NO.4 (20) – THE  VALLABHDAS  H.  ADWALIA TROPHY RUN ON 25<sup>TH</sup>\r\nNOVEMBER 2012 – DOUBLE DECLARATION FOR JOCKEY CS JODHA</span></u></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.5pt;text-align:justify'><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.5pt;text-align:justify'><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>Jockey C.S.Jodha\r\nwas declared to ride by two Trainers viz. Mr.Subhag Singh on his charge PERFECT\r\nSTRENGTH and Mr.S.S.Shah on his charge DANCING SPLENDOUR. After enquiring,\r\nTrainer Subhag Singh has been fined Rs.1,000/- for declaring the Jockey without\r\nhis consent. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:center'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>-----------------------</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:justify'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>&nbsp;</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:4.7pt;text-align:justify'><b><span\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>Mumbai : 30<sup>th</sup>\r\nNovember, 2012</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:\"Trebuchet MS\",\"sans-serif\"'>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n"},"error":null}